;; Most bytes kept from one stdout or stderr stream of a child process
;; (64 MiB). The largest miniforge agent session transcript measured on
;; 2026-11-08 was 8.4 MB over 109 task runs, so this leaves 8x headroom;
;; a runaway writer is cut here instead of filling the JVM heap.
{:subprocess/max-captured-bytes 67108864}
